From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: janpagu <janpagu@alumni.uv.es>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:42:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] NX2Apple: port Factorio OpenGL paths

Co-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Factorio needs multiple framebuffer color attachments, indexed color masks, integer vertex attributes, texture queries, sampler objects, and framebuffer-to-texture copies; these paths are adapted to NX2Apple's pinned OpenGL ABI.
Issue: none

